[
    "<a class=\"vertical-page-list-item -medium up-can-clean\" infinite_nodes_uniq_on=\"44666\" href=\"/en/press-releases/volkswagen-group-cooperates-with-valeo-and-mobileye-to-enhance-driver-assistance-in-future-mqb-vehicles-19130\"><div class=\"vertical-page-list-item--badge\">\n<div class=\"badge\"><time datetime=\"2025-03-25\">03/25/2025</time><span>Press Release</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"vertical-page-list-item--title\">\nVolkswagen Group cooperates with Valeo and Mobileye to enhance driver assistance in future MQB vehicles\n</div>\n<div class=\"vertical-page-list-item--intro\">\nVolkswagen Group is working with Valeo and Mobileye to upgrade the advanced driver assistance systems up to Level 2+ ('enhanced partially automated driving') in its upcoming vehicle portfolio based on the MQB platform. Launching in the next few years, this cooperation will improve safety and driving comfort in high-volume vehicles, addressing both customer expectations and regulatory requirements.\n</div>\n<div class=\"vertical-page-list-item--image\">\n<span id=\"element_uid_1_root\" class=\"cropped-image\"><span class=\"cropped-image--sizer\" style=\"--image-aspect-ratio: 16/9\"></span><img alt=\"Image featuring the logos of Volkswagen Group, Valeo, and Mobileye above the front of a moving vehicle, captured from a top-down perspective on a dark road.\" style=\"width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;object-position:46% 47%\" src=\"https://uploads.vw-mms.de/system/production/images/cws/084/270/images/5a88096b4f326ae3a66f3718b08a7bf21d492341/B2025CW00132_web_1600.jpg?1742888050\" srcset=\"https://uploads.vw-mms.de/system/production/images/cws/084/270/images/5a88096b4f326ae3a66f3718b08a7bf21d492341/B2025CW00132_retina_2400.jpg?1742888050 1920w 1080h, https://uploads.vw-mms.de/system/production/images/cws/084/270/images/5a88096b4f326ae3a66f3718b08a7bf21d492341/B2025CW00132_retina_2000.jpg?1742888050 1920w 1080h, https://uploads.vw-mms.de/system/production/images/cws/084/270/images/5a88096b4f326ae3a66f3718b08a7bf21d492341/B2025CW00132_web_1600.jpg?1742888050 1600w 900h, https://uploads.vw-mms.de/system/production/images/cws/084/270/images/5a88096b4f326ae3a66f3718b08a7bf21d492341/B2025CW00132_web_1160.jpg?1742888050 1160w 653h, https://uploads.vw-mms.de/system/production/images/cws/084/270/images/5a88096b4f326ae3a66f3718b08a7bf21d492341/B2025CW00132_web_804.jpg?1742888050 804w 452h, https://uploads.vw-mms.de/system/production/images/cws/084/270/images/5a88096b4f326ae3a66f3718b08a7bf21d492341/B2025CW00132_web_466.jpg?1742888050 466w 262h, https://uploads.vw-mms.de/system/production/images/cws/084/270/images/5a88096b4f326ae3a66f3718b08a7bf21d492341/B2025CW00132_web_390.jpg?1742888050 390w 219h\" data-sizes=\"auto\" data-srcset=\"https://uploads.vw-mms.de/system/production/images/cws/084/270/images/5a88096b4f326ae3a66f3718b08a7bf21d492341/B2025CW00132_retina_2400.jpg?1742888050 1920w 1080h, https://uploads.vw-mms.de/system/production/images/cws/084/270/images/5a88096b4f326ae3a66f3718b08a7bf21d492341/B2025CW00132_retina_2000.jpg?1742888050 1920w 1080h, https://uploads.vw-mms.de/system/production/images/cws/084/270/images/5a88096b4f326ae3a66f3718b08a7bf21d492341/B2025CW00132_web_1600.jpg?1742888050 1600w 900h, https://uploads.vw-mms.de/system/production/images/cws/084/270/images/5a88096b4f326ae3a66f3718b08a7bf21d492341/B2025CW00132_web_1160.jpg?1742888050 1160w 653h, https://uploads.vw-mms.de/system/production/images/cws/084/270/images/5a88096b4f326ae3a66f3718b08a7bf21d492341/B2025CW00132_web_804.jpg?1742888050 804w 452h, https://uploads.vw-mms.de/system/production/images/cws/084/270/images/5a88096b4f326ae3a66f3718b08a7bf21d492341/B2025CW00132_web_466.jpg?1742888050 466w 262h, https://uploads.vw-mms.de/system/production/images/cws/084/270/images/5a88096b4f326ae3a66f3718b08a7bf21d492341/B2025CW00132_web_390.jpg?1742888050 390w 219h\" class=\"lazyautosizes ls-is-cached lazyloaded\" decoding=\"async\" sizes=\"250.66666666666666px\"></span>\n</div>\n</a>",
    "<a class=\"vertical-page-list-item -medium up-can-clean\" infinite_nodes_uniq_on=\"44600\" href=\"/en/press-releases/change-on-volkswagen-supervisory-board-christiane-benner-to-follow-joerg-hofmann-19082\"><div class=\"vertical-page-list-item--badge\">\n<div class=\"badge\"><time datetime=\"2025-03-14\">03/14/2025</time><span>Press Release</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"vertical-page-list-item--title\">\nChange on Volkswagen Supervisory Board: Christiane Benner to follow J\u00f6rg Hofmann\n</div>\n<div class=\"vertical-page-list-item--intro\">\nA planned change has been effected among the employee representatives on the Supervisory Board of Volkswagen AG. The Chair of IG Metall, Christiane Benner, is taking over from her predecessor J\u00f6rg Hofmann and will thus also assume the role of Deputy to the Chair of the Supervisory Board, Hans Dieter P\u00f6tsch. At the same time, she will also replace Hofmann on the Executive Committee.\n</div>\n<div class=\"vertical-page-list-item--image\">\n<span id=\"element_uid_2_root\" class=\"cropped-image\"><span class=\"cropped-image--sizer\" style=\"--image-aspect-ratio: 3/2\"></span><img alt=\"Christiane Benner, Chairwoman of the Metalworkers' Union IG Metall\" style=\"width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;object-position:center 0%\" src=\"https://uploads.vw-mms.de/system/production/images/cws/084/133/images/ee67ee74519ac296fb9079e15c930a1b87391977/B2025CW00114_web_1600.jpg?1741620269\" srcset=\"https://uploads.vw-mms.de/system/production/images/cws/084/133/images/ee67ee74519ac296fb9079e15c930a1b87391977/B2025CW00114_retina_2400.jpg?1741620269 1438w 959h, https://uploads.vw-mms.de/system/production/images/cws/084/133/images/ee67ee74519ac296fb9079e15c930a1b87391977/B2025CW00114_retina_2000.jpg?1741620269 1438w 959h, https://uploads.vw-mms.de/system/production/images/cws/084/133/images/ee67ee74519ac296fb9079e15c930a1b87391977/B2025CW00114_web_1600.jpg?1741620269 1438w 959h, https://uploads.vw-mms.de/system/production/images/cws/084/133/images/ee67ee74519ac296fb9079e15c930a1b87391977/B2025CW00114_web_1160.jpg?1741620269 1160w 774h, https://uploads.vw-mms.de/system/production/images/cws/084/133/images/ee67ee74519ac296fb9079e15c930a1b87391977/B2025CW00114_web_804.jpg?1741620269 804w 536h, https://uploads.vw-mms.de/system/production/images/cws/084/133/images/ee67ee74519ac296fb9079e15c930a1b87391977/B2025CW00114_web_466.jpg?1741620269 466w 311h, https://uploads.vw-mms.de/system/production/images/cws/084/133/images/ee67ee74519ac296fb9079e15c930a1b87391977/B2025CW00114_web_390.jpg?1741620269 390w 260h\" data-sizes=\"auto\" data-srcset=\"https://uploads.vw-mms.de/system/production/images/cws/084/133/images/ee67ee74519ac296fb9079e15c930a1b87391977/B2025CW00114_retina_2400.jpg?1741620269 1438w 959h, https://uploads.vw-mms.de/system/production/images/cws/084/133/images/ee67ee74519ac296fb9079e15c930a1b87391977/B2025CW00114_retina_2000.jpg?1741620269 1438w 959h, https://uploads.vw-mms.de/system/production/images/cws/084/133/images/ee67ee74519ac296fb9079e15c930a1b87391977/B2025CW00114_web_1600.jpg?1741620269 1438w 959h, https://uploads.vw-mms.de/system/production/images/cws/084/133/images/ee67ee74519ac296fb9079e15c930a1b87391977/B2025CW00114_web_1160.jpg?1741620269 1160w 774h, https://uploads.vw-mms.de/system/production/images/cws/084/133/images/ee67ee74519ac296fb9079e15c930a1b87391977/B2025CW00114_web_804.jpg?1741620269 804w 536h, https://uploads.vw-mms.de/system/production/images/cws/084/133/images/ee67ee74519ac296fb9079e15c930a1b87391977/B2025CW00114_web_466.jpg?1741620269 466w 311h, https://uploads.vw-mms.de/system/production/images/cws/084/133/images/ee67ee74519ac296fb9079e15c930a1b87391977/B2025CW00114_web_390.jpg?1741620269 390w 260h\" class=\"lazyautosizes ls-is-cached lazyloaded\" decoding=\"async\" sizes=\"250.41293013555787px\"></span>\n</div>\n</a>",
    "<a class=\"vertical-page-list-item -medium up-can-clean\" infinite_nodes_uniq_on=\"44527\" href=\"/en/press-releases/volkswagen-group-with-solid-fy-2024-results-and-a-robust-outlook-19043\"><div class=\"vertical-page-list-item--badge\">\n<div class=\"badge\"><time datetime=\"2025-03-11\">03/11/2025</time><span>Press Release</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"vertical-page-list-item--title\">\nVolkswagen Group with solid FY 2024 results and a robust outlook\n</div>\n<div class=\"vertical-page-list-item--intro\">\nOn March 11, 2025, the Volkswagen Group will publish the Full Year Results 2024.\n</div>\n<div class=\"vertical-page-list-item--image\">\n<span id=\"element_uid_3_root\" class=\"cropped-image\"><span class=\"cropped-image--sizer\" style=\"--image-aspect-ratio: 3/2\"></span><img alt=\"Graphic for the Volkswagen Group Annual Media Conference 25, featuring an abstract, wave-like structure in orange and dark tones. The background is dark blue, with the Volkswagen Group logo in the upper right corner.\" style=\"width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;object-position:0% center\" src=\"https://uploads.vw-mms.de/system/production/images/cws/083/817/images/946eb88fee90c84c32c69fd9ef4cf55f737a32d4/B2025CW00048_web_1600.png?1740497277\" srcset=\"https://uploads.vw-mms.de/system/production/images/cws/083/817/images/946eb88fee90c84c32c69fd9ef4cf55f737a32d4/B2025CW00048_retina_2400.png?1740497277 1920w 1080h, https://uploads.vw-mms.de/system/production/images/cws/083/817/images/946eb88fee90c84c32c69fd9ef4cf55f737a32d4/B2025CW00048_retina_2000.png?1740497277 1920w 1080h, https://uploads.vw-mms.de/system/production/images/cws/083/817/images/946eb88fee90c84c32c69fd9ef4cf55f737a32d4/B2025CW00048_web_1600.png?1740497277 1600w 900h, https://uploads.vw-mms.de/system/production/images/cws/083/817/images/946eb88fee90c84c32c69fd9ef4cf55f737a32d4/B2025CW00048_web_1160.png?1740497277 1160w 653h, https://uploads.vw-mms.de/system/production/images/cws/083/817/images/946eb88fee90c84c32c69fd9ef4cf55f737a32d4/B2025CW00048_web_804.png?1740497277 804w 452h, https://uploads.vw-mms.de/system/production/images/cws/083/817/images/946eb88fee90c84c32c69fd9ef4cf55f737a32d4/B2025CW00048_web_466.png?1740497277 466w 262h, https://uploads.vw-mms.de/system/production/images/cws/083/817/images/946eb88fee90c84c32c69fd9ef4cf55f737a32d4/B2025CW00048_web_390.png?1740497277 390w 219h\" data-sizes=\"auto\" data-srcset=\"https://uploads.vw-mms.de/system/production/images/cws/083/817/images/946eb88fee90c84c32c69fd9ef4cf55f737a32d4/B2025CW00048_retina_2400.png?1740497277 1920w 1080h, https://uploads.vw-mms.de/system/production/images/cws/083/817/images/946eb88fee90c84c32c69fd9ef4cf55f737a32d4/B2025CW00048_retina_2000.png?1740497277 1920w 1080h, https://uploads.vw-mms.de/system/production/images/cws/083/817/images/946eb88fee90c84c32c69fd9ef4cf55f737a32d4/B2025CW00048_web_1600.png?1740497277 1600w 900h, https://uploads.vw-mms.de/system/production/images/cws/083/817/images/946eb88fee90c84c32c69fd9ef4cf55f737a32d4/B2025CW00048_web_1160.png?1740497277 1160w 653h, https://uploads.vw-mms.de/system/production/images/cws/083/817/images/946eb88fee90c84c32c69fd9ef4cf55f737a32d4/B2025CW00048_web_804.png?1740497277 804w 452h, https://uploads.vw-mms.de/system/production/images/cws/083/817/images/946eb88fee90c84c32c69fd9ef4cf55f737a32d4/B2025CW00048_web_466.png?1740497277 466w 262h, https://uploads.vw-mms.de/system/production/images/cws/083/817/images/946eb88fee90c84c32c69fd9ef4cf55f737a32d4/B2025CW00048_web_390.png?1740497277 390w 219h\" class=\"lazyautosizes ls-is-cached lazyloaded\" decoding=\"async\" sizes=\"296.88888888888886px\"></span>\n</div>\n</a>",
    "<a class=\"vertical-page-list-item -medium up-can-clean\" infinite_nodes_uniq_on=\"44450\" href=\"/en/press-releases/software-development-volkswagen-group-and-cgi-deepen-global-collaboration-19004\"><div class=\"vertical-page-list-item--badge\">\n<div class=\"badge\"><time datetime=\"2025-02-17\">02/17/2025</time><span>Press Release</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"vertical-page-list-item--title\">\nSoftware development: Volkswagen Group and CGI deepen global collaboration\n</div>\n<div class=\"vertical-page-list-item--intro\">\nThe Volkswagen Group and CGI, one of the world\u2019s largest business and IT consulting firms, announce the deepening of their global collaboration.  This move strengthens the Volkswagen Group\u2019s long-term capabilities to further expand a powerful IT infrastructure for the future. As part of their joint efforts, both partners have launched the new entity MARV1N (pronounced \u201cMarvin\u201d) which will act as an international development unit for Group-wide digitalization projects and support the developers at Volkswagen. With these additional resources, the Volkswagen Group plans to develop new IT systems faster and more efficiently.\n</div>\n<div class=\"vertical-page-list-item--image\">\n<span id=\"element_uid_4_root\" class=\"cropped-image\"><span class=\"cropped-image--sizer\" style=\"--image-aspect-ratio: 3/2\"></span><img alt=\"Hauke Stars, Board Member at Volkswagen Group for IT, in front of a dark blue painting with different shades.\" style=\"width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;object-position:center\" src=\"https://uploads.vw-mms.de/system/production/images/cws/083/679/images/da44445c080f1502333f1d7d57585659609c8b4e/B2025CW00027_web_1600.jpg?1739792730\" srcset=\"https://uploads.vw-mms.de/system/production/images/cws/083/679/images/da44445c080f1502333f1d7d57585659609c8b4e/B2025CW00027_retina_2400.jpg?1739792730 2400w 1600h, https://uploads.vw-mms.de/system/production/images/cws/083/679/images/da44445c080f1502333f1d7d57585659609c8b4e/B2025CW00027_retina_2000.jpg?1739792730 2000w 1333h, https://uploads.vw-mms.de/system/production/images/cws/083/679/images/da44445c080f1502333f1d7d57585659609c8b4e/B2025CW00027_web_1600.jpg?1739792730 1600w 1067h, https://uploads.vw-mms.de/system/production/images/cws/083/679/images/da44445c080f1502333f1d7d57585659609c8b4e/B2025CW00027_web_1160.jpg?1739792730 1160w 773h, https://uploads.vw-mms.de/system/production/images/cws/083/679/images/da44445c080f1502333f1d7d57585659609c8b4e/B2025CW00027_web_804.jpg?1739792730 804w 536h, https://uploads.vw-mms.de/system/production/images/cws/083/679/images/da44445c080f1502333f1d7d57585659609c8b4e/B2025CW00027_web_466.jpg?1739792730 466w 311h, https://uploads.vw-mms.de/system/production/images/cws/083/679/images/da44445c080f1502333f1d7d57585659609c8b4e/B2025CW00027_web_390.jpg?1739792730 390w 260h\" data-sizes=\"auto\" data-srcset=\"https://uploads.vw-mms.de/system/production/images/cws/083/679/images/da44445c080f1502333f1d7d57585659609c8b4e/B2025CW00027_retina_2400.jpg?1739792730 2400w 1600h, https://uploads.vw-mms.de/system/production/images/cws/083/679/images/da44445c080f1502333f1d7d57585659609c8b4e/B2025CW00027_retina_2000.jpg?1739792730 2000w 1333h, https://uploads.vw-mms.de/system/production/images/cws/083/679/images/da44445c080f1502333f1d7d57585659609c8b4e/B2025CW00027_web_1600.jpg?1739792730 1600w 1067h, https://uploads.vw-mms.de/system/production/images/cws/083/679/images/da44445c080f1502333f1d7d57585659609c8b4e/B2025CW00027_web_1160.jpg?1739792730 1160w 773h, https://uploads.vw-mms.de/system/production/images/cws/083/679/images/da44445c080f1502333f1d7d57585659609c8b4e/B2025CW00027_web_804.jpg?1739792730 804w 536h, https://uploads.vw-mms.de/system/production/images/cws/083/679/images/da44445c080f1502333f1d7d57585659609c8b4e/B2025CW00027_web_466.jpg?1739792730 466w 311h, https://uploads.vw-mms.de/system/production/images/cws/083/679/images/da44445c080f1502333f1d7d57585659609c8b4e/B2025CW00027_web_390.jpg?1739792730 390w 260h\" class=\"lazyautosizes ls-is-cached lazyloaded\" decoding=\"async\" sizes=\"250.5px\"></span>\n</div>\n</a>",
    "<a class=\"vertical-page-list-item -medium up-can-clean\" infinite_nodes_uniq_on=\"44362\" href=\"/en/press-releases/volkswagen-merges-charging-and-fueling-services-under-new-company-18975\"><div class=\"vertical-page-list-item--badge\">\n<div class=\"badge\"><time datetime=\"2025-01-15\">01/15/2025</time><span>Press Release</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"vertical-page-list-item--title\">\nVolkswagen merges charging and fueling services under new company\n</div>\n<div class=\"vertical-page-list-item--intro\">\nThe Volkswagen Group is strengthening its charging and fueling services through the merger of LOGPAY Transport Services GmbH, a subsidiary of Volkswagen Financial Services AG, and the mobility service units of Volkswagen Group Charging GmbH (Elli). This strategic merger lays the foundation for future growth by offering seamless mobility services and an expanded range of solutions to both business and private customers transitioning to e-mobility. The newly established Elli Mobility GmbH, as a result of this merger, will operate as a wholly owned subsidiary of Volkswagen Group Charging GmbH (Elli) starting (expected) in March 2025.<sup consumption-data=\"\" up-data=\"&quot;The transaction is subject to the necessary regulatory approvals and authorizations.&quot;\" class=\"inline-consumption-data up-can-clean\">01</sup>\n</div>\n<div class=\"vertical-page-list-item--image\">\n<span id=\"element_uid_5_root\" class=\"cropped-image\"><span class=\"cropped-image--sizer\" style=\"--image-aspect-ratio: 3/2\"></span><img alt=\"Purple logo of Elli, a Volkswagen Group company, with a dot pattern.\" style=\"width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;object-position:center 50%\" src=\"https://uploads.vw-mms.de/system/production/images/cws/080/945/images/cd891a1b7f0d2d5c1cc869e775224ec80d7486ab/B2024CW00051_web_1600.png?1707379890\" srcset=\"https://uploads.vw-mms.de/system/production/images/cws/080/945/images/cd891a1b7f0d2d5c1cc869e775224ec80d7486ab/B2024CW00051_reti