    "<a class=\"vertical-page-list-item -medium up-can-clean\" infinite_nodes_uniq_on=\"44345\" href=\"/en/press-releases/volkswagen-group-with-9-million-deliveries-after-strong-fourth-quarter-18965\"><div class=\"vertical-page-list-item--badge\">\n<div class=\"badge\"><time datetime=\"2025-01-14\">01/14/2025</time><span>Press Release</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"vertical-page-list-item--title\">\nVolkswagen Group with 9 million deliveries after strong fourth quarter\n</div>\n<div class=\"vertical-page-list-item--intro\">\nOn January 14, 2025, the Volkswagen Group published the deliveries for October to December 2024.\n</div>\n<div class=\"vertical-page-list-item--image\">\n<span id=\"element_uid_6_root\" class=\"cropped-image\"><span class=\"cropped-image--sizer\" style=\"--image-aspect-ratio: 1800/1013\"></span><img alt=\"Deliveries 2024 Volkswagen Group\" style=\"width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;object-position:center\" src=\"https://uploads.vw-mms.de/system/production/images/cws/083/623/images_file_en/d2b7632f96e552048a10f65fe57141e86a2bd88f/B2025CW00007_web_1600.jpg?1736849821\" srcset=\"https://uploads.vw-mms.de/system/production/images/cws/083/623/images_file_en/d2b7632f96e552048a10f65fe57141e86a2bd88f/B2025CW00007_retina_2400.jpg?1736849821 1800w 1013h, https://uploads.vw-mms.de/system/production/images/cws/083/623/images_file_en/d2b7632f96e552048a10f65fe57141e86a2bd88f/B2025CW00007_retina_2000.jpg?1736849821 1800w 1013h, https://uploads.vw-mms.de/system/production/images/cws/083/623/images_file_en/d2b7632f96e552048a10f65fe57141e86a2bd88f/B2025CW00007_web_1600.jpg?1736849821 1600w 900h, https://uploads.vw-mms.de/system/production/images/cws/083/623/images_file_en/d2b7632f96e552048a10f65fe57141e86a2bd88f/B2025CW00007_web_1160.jpg?1736849821 1160w 653h, https://uploads.vw-mms.de/system/production/images/cws/083/623/images_file_en/d2b7632f96e552048a10f65fe57141e86a2bd88f/B2025CW00007_web_804.jpg?1736849821 804w 452h, https://uploads.vw-mms.de/system/production/images/cws/083/623/images_file_en/d2b7632f96e552048a10f65fe57141e86a2bd88f/B2025CW00007_web_466.jpg?1736849821 466w 262h, https://uploads.vw-mms.de/system/production/images/cws/083/623/images_file_en/d2b7632f96e552048a10f65fe57141e86a2bd88f/B2025CW00007_web_390.jpg?1736849821 390w 219h\" data-sizes=\"auto\" data-srcset=\"https://uploads.vw-mms.de/system/production/images/cws/083/623/images_file_en/d2b7632f96e552048a10f65fe57141e86a2bd88f/B2025CW00007_retina_2400.jpg?1736849821 1800w 1013h, https://uploads.vw-mms.de/system/production/images/cws/083/623/images_file_en/d2b7632f96e552048a10f65fe57141e86a2bd88f/B2025CW00007_retina_2000.jpg?1736849821 1800w 1013h, https://uploads.vw-mms.de/system/production/images/cws/083/623/images_file_en/d2b7632f96e552048a10f65fe57141e86a2bd88f/B2025CW00007_web_1600.jpg?1736849821 1600w 900h, https://uploads.vw-mms.de/system/production/images/cws/083/623/images_file_en/d2b7632f96e552048a10f65fe57141e86a2bd88f/B2025CW00007_web_1160.jpg?1736849821 1160w 653h, https://uploads.vw-mms.de/system/production/images/cws/083/623/images_file_en/d2b7632f96e552048a10f65fe57141e86a2bd88f/B2025CW00007_web_804.jpg?1736849821 804w 452h, https://uploads.vw-mms.de/system/production/images/cws/083/623/images_file_en/d2b7632f96e552048a10f65fe57141e86a2bd88f/B2025CW00007_web_466.jpg?1736849821 466w 262h, https://uploads.vw-mms.de/system/production/images/cws/083/623/images_file_en/d2b7632f96e552048a10f65fe57141e86a2bd88f/B2025CW00007_web_390.jpg?1736849821 390w 219h\" class=\"lazyautosizes ls-is-cached lazyloaded\" decoding=\"async\" sizes=\"250.54294175715697px\"></span>\n</div>\n</a>",
    "<a class=\"vertical-page-list-item -medium up-can-clean\" infinite_nodes_uniq_on=\"44252\" href=\"/en/press-releases/agreement-reached-volkswagen-ag-positions-itself-competitively-for-the-future-18911\"><div class=\"vertical-page-list-item--badge\">\n<div class=\"badge\"><time datetime=\"2024-12-20\">12/20/2024</time><span>Press Release</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"vertical-page-list-item--title\">\nAgreement reached: Volkswagen AG positions itself competitively for the future\n</div>\n<div class=\"vertical-page-list-item--intro\">\nFollowing intensive negotiations between Volkswagen AG, IG Metall and the Works Council, a joint agreement entitled \u2018Zukunft Volkswagen\u2019 [Future Volkswagen] has been concluded.  The company and the Works Council are thereby jointly positioning Volkswagen AG for sustainable success. To this end, the company is realigning production capacities at Volkswagen AG's German locations. To this end, the company is realigning production capacities at Volkswagen AG's German locations. It is creating the conditions for a reduction in labour costs of \u20ac1.5 billion per year at the collectively agreed level with an agreement on the company wage settlement until 2030. The short-term reduction in labour costs and the agreed structural measures through capacity reduction and a decrease in development costs will lead to cost savings of over \u20ac4 billion per year in the medium term. In addition, a reduction in capacity of 734,000 units across the German plants is planned. This will enable Volkswagen AG to lay the foundation for important investments in future products through to 2030. The structural realignment of the company at an operational and collective level will create the conditions for achieving the return-on-sales target for the Volkswagen Passenger Cars brand in the medium term.\n</div>\n<div class=\"vertical-page-list-item--image\">\n<span id=\"element_uid_7_root\" class=\"cropped-image\"><span class=\"cropped-image--sizer\" style=\"--image-aspect-ratio: 3/2\"></span><img alt=\"Abstract wave shape in dark blue tones.\" style=\"width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;object-position:50% center\" src=\"https://uploads.vw-mms.de/system/production/images/cws/081/255/images/58535d186d993ddf7197e56d10ee14bad022ed8d/B2024CW00084_web_1600.jpg?1739540401\" srcset=\"https://uploads.vw-mms.de/system/production/images/cws/081/255/images/58535d186d993ddf7197e56d10ee14bad022ed8d/B2024CW00084_retina_2400.jpg?1739540401 1920w 1080h, https://uploads.vw-mms.de/system/production/images/cws/081/255/images/58535d186d993ddf7197e56d10ee14bad022ed8d/B2024CW00084_retina_2000.jpg?1739540401 1920w 1080h, https://uploads.vw-mms.de/system/production/images/cws/081/255/images/58535d186d993ddf7197e56d10ee14bad022ed8d/B2024CW00084_web_1600.jpg?1739540401 1600w 900h, https://uploads.vw-mms.de/system/production/images/cws/081/255/images/58535d186d993ddf7197e56d10ee14bad022ed8d/B2024CW00084_web_1160.jpg?1739540401 1160w 653h, https://uploads.vw-mms.de/system/production/images/cws/081/255/images/58535d186d993ddf7197e56d10ee14bad022ed8d/B2024CW00084_web_804.jpg?1739540401 804w 452h, https://uploads.vw-mms.de/system/production/images/cws/081/255/images/58535d186d993ddf7197e56d10ee14bad022ed8d/B2024CW00084_web_466.jpg?1739540401 466w 262h, https://uploads.vw-mms.de/system/production/images/cws/081/255/images/58535d186d993ddf7197e56d10ee14bad022ed8d/B2024CW00084_web_390.jpg?1739540401 390w 219h\" data-sizes=\"auto\" data-srcset=\"https://uploads.vw-mms.de/system/production/images/cws/081/255/images/58535d186d993ddf7197e56d10ee14bad022ed8d/B2024CW00084_retina_2400.jpg?1739540401 1920w 1080h, https://uploads.vw-mms.de/system/production/images/cws/081/255/images/58535d186d993ddf7197e56d10ee14bad022ed8d/B2024CW00084_retina_2000.jpg?1739540401 1920w 1080h, https://uploads.vw-mms.de/system/production/images/cws/081/255/images/58535d186d993ddf7197e56d10ee14bad022ed8d/B2024CW00084_web_1600.jpg?1739540401 1600w 900h, https://uploads.vw-mms.de/system/production/images/cws/081/255/images/58535d186d993ddf7197e56d10ee14bad022ed8d/B2024CW00084_web_1160.jpg?1739540401 1160w 653h, https://uploads.vw-mms.de/system/production/images/cws/081/255/images/58535d186d993ddf7197e56d10ee14bad022ed8d/B2024CW00084_web_804.jpg?1739540401 804w 452h, https://uploads.vw-mms.de/system/production/images/cws/081/255/images/58535d186d993ddf7197e56d10ee14bad022ed8d/B2024CW00084_web_466.jpg?1739540401 466w 262h, https://uploads.vw-mms.de/system/production/images/cws/081/255/images/58535d186d993ddf7197e56d10ee14bad022ed8d/B2024CW00084_web_390.jpg?1739540401 390w 219h\" class=\"lazyautosizes lazyloaded\" decoding=\"async\" sizes=\"296.88888888888886px\"></span>\n</div>\n</a>",
    "<a class=\"vertical-page-list-item -medium up-can-clean\" infinite_nodes_uniq_on=\"44246\" href=\"/en/press-releases/volkswagen-and-powerco-make-strategic-investment-in-north-american-lithium-company-patriot-battery-metals-18910\"><div class=\"vertical-page-list-item--badge\">\n<div class=\"badge\"><time datetime=\"2024-12-18\">12/18/2024</time><span>Press Release</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"vertical-page-list-item--title\">\nVolkswagen and PowerCo Make Strategic Investment in North American Lithium Company Patriot Battery Metals\n</div>\n<div class=\"vertical-page-list-item--intro\">\nPowerCo SE, Volkswagen Group\u2019s battery company, and Patriot Battery Metals Inc. (TSX: PMET | ASX: PMT | OTCQX: PMETF | FSE: R9GA) today announced they have entered into a strategic partnership. This is the first investment for PowerCo and Volkswagen in the lithium supply chain, underlining PowerCo\u2019s ambition to execute on its vertical integration strategy \u2013 from mine to battery. The partnership ensures the long-term supply of lithium raw materials through a binding offtake commitment. Additionally, the companies will jointly explore further strategic opportunities such as a downstream lithium supply chain with a focus on cost competitiveness, high ESG standards and long-term security.\n</div>\n<div class=\"vertical-page-list-item--image\">\n<span id=\"element_uid_8_root\" class=\"cropped-image\"><span class=\"cropped-image--sizer\" style=\"--image-aspect-ratio: 3/2\"></span><img alt=\"Close-up of two hands examining a rock fragment. One person is wearing a high-visibility vest with reflective stripes, suggesting work in construction, mining, or a similar industrial setting. The background features a rocky surface with lichen growth.\" style=\"width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;object-position:50% 50%\" src=\"https://uploads.vw-mms.de/system/production/images/cws/083/575/images/52208817210690abcfea58ccea4638e56a362b48/B2024CW00449_web_1600.jpg?1734510134\" srcset=\"https://uploads.vw-mms.de/system/production/images/cws/083/575/images/52208817210690abcfea58ccea4638e56a362b48/B2024CW00449_retina_2400.jpg?1734510134 1920w 1280h, https://uploads.vw-mms.de/system/production/images/cws/083/575/images/52208817210690abcfea58ccea4638e56a362b48/B2024CW00449_retina_2000.jpg?1734510134 1920w 1280h, https://uploads.vw-mms.de/system/production/images/cws/083/575/images/52208817210690abcfea58ccea4638e56a362b48/B2024CW00449_web_1600.jpg?1734510134 1600w 1067h, https://uploads.vw-mms.de/system/production/images/cws/083/575/images/52208817210690abcfea58ccea4638e56a362b48/B2024CW00449_web_1160.jpg?1734510134 1160w 773h, https://uploads.vw-mms.de/system/production/images/cws/083/575/images/52208817210690abcfea58ccea4638e56a362b48/B2024CW00449_web_804.jpg?1734510134 804w 536h, https://uploads.vw-mms.de/system/production/images/cws/083/575/images/52208817210690abcfea58ccea4638e56a362b48/B2024CW00449_web_466.jpg?1734510134 466w 311h, https://uploads.vw-mms.de/system/production/images/cws/083/575/images/52208817210690abcfea58ccea4638e56a362b48/B2024CW00449_web_390.jpg?1734510134 390w 260h\" data-sizes=\"auto\" data-srcset=\"https://uploads.vw-mms.de/system/production/images/cws/083/575/images/52208817210690abcfea58ccea4638e56a362b48/B2024CW00449_retina_2400.jpg?1734510134 1920w 1280h, https://uploads.vw-mms.de/system/production/images/cws/083/575/images/52208817210690abcfea58ccea4638e56a362b48/B2024CW00449_retina_2000.jpg?1734510134 1920w 1280h, https://uploads.vw-mms.de/system/production/images/cws/083/575/images/52208817210690abcfea58ccea4638e56a362b48/B2024CW00449_web_1600.jpg?1734510134 1600w 1067h, https://uploads.vw-mms.de/system/production/images/cws/083/575/images/52208817210690abcfea58ccea4638e56a362b48/B2024CW00449_web_1160.jpg?1734510134 1160w 773h, https://uploads.vw-mms.de/system/production/images/cws/083/575/images/52208817210690abcfea58ccea4638e56a362b48/B2024CW00449_web_804.jpg?1734510134 804w 536h, https://uploads.vw-mms.de/system/production/images/cws/083/575/images/52208817210690abcfea58ccea4638e56a362b48/B2024CW00449_web_466.jpg?1734510134 466w 311h, https://uploads.vw-mms.de/system/production/images/cws/083/575/images/52208817210690abcfea58ccea4638e56a362b48/B2024CW00449_web_390.jpg?1734510134 390w 260h\" class=\"lazyautosizes lazyloaded\" decoding=\"async\" sizes=\"250.5px\"></span>\n</div>\n</a>",
    "<a class=\"vertical-page-list-item -medium up-can-clean\" infinite_nodes_uniq_on=\"44212\" href=\"/en/press-releases/green-energy-for-gigafactory-salzgitter-18894\"><div class=\"vertical-page-list-item--badge\">\n<div class=\"badge\"><time datetime=\"2024-12-10\">12/10/2024</time><span>Press Release</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"vertical-page-list-item--title\">\nGreen energy for Gigafactory Salzgitter\n</div>\n<div class=\"vertical-page-list-item--intro\">\nPowerCo SE relies on climate-friendly electricity for the operation of its cell factories. For the Salzgitter gigafactory, it has now concluded the first long-term purchase agreements with the green energy producers Alterric and EnviTec Biogas AG. From 2025, they will supply around 240 gigawatt hours per year from wind power (Alterric) and around 65 gigawatt hours from solar energy (EnviTec Biogas AG). Over the entire term of ten years, this will result in a total of 3 terawatt hours of green electricity, which will be used to operate the Salzgitter gigafactory.\n</div>\n<div class=\"vertical-page-list-item--image\">\n<span id=\"element_uid_9_root\" class=\"cropped-image\"><span class=\"cropped-image--sizer\" style=\"--image-aspect-ratio: 3/2\"></span><img alt=\"A green meadow filled with white flowers, featuring a row of solar panels in the foreground. Wind turbines rotate in the background, emphasizing renewable energy and sustainability. The cloudy sky adds a calm and natural atmosphere to the scene.\" style=\"width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;object-position:center 50%\" src=\"https://uploads.vw-mms.de/system/production/images/cws/083/484/images/f7dbeb1868b1eb0f474ad4aa739e7dc4030bfbfb/B2024CW00428_web_1600.jpg?1733824469\" srcset=\"https://uploads.vw-mms.de/system/production/images/cws/083/484/images/f7dbeb1868b1eb0f474ad4aa739e7dc4030bfbfb/B2024CW00428_retina_2400.jpg?1733824469 2400w 1717h, https://uploads.vw-mms.de/system/production/images/cws/083/484/images/f7dbeb1868b1eb0f474ad4aa739e7d